        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(20,42,73,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="13" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" textAlign="left"><p>　核心功能</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="47">
        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(20,42,73,0.05)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" textAlign="center"><p>干部管理</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(62,76,92,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>　干部档案增删改查、批量导入导出、多条件筛选排序，在职 / 离退休 / 调出 / 辞职分库，后备干部入库与培养跟踪</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="47">
        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(20,42,73,0.05)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" textAlign="center"><p>组织机构</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(62,76,92,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>　机构树形管理、编制数与实有人数实时维护、班子成员任职登记、职务层次与职级统一管理</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="47">
        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(20,42,73,0.05)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" textAlign="center"><p>干部业务</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(62,76,92,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>　任免全流程、调动转任、职级晋升、考察登记、政策法规台账，以及干部档案更正自助申报审批闭环</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="47">
        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(20,42,73,0.05)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" textAlign="center"><p>监督考核</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(62,76,92,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>　年度考核、民主测评、平板评审投票与手写签字留证、廉政信访、个人事项、红橙黄分级预警</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="47">
        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(20,42,73,0.05)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" textAlign="center"><p>日常事务</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(62,76,92,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>　证照、出境记录、休假、教育培训、挂职锻炼，以及请假 / 培训 / 出国（境）等干部自助申报审批</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="47">
        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(20,42,73,0.05)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" textAlign="center"><p>统计分析</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(62,76,92,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>　年龄、性别、学历、政治面貌、职务层次结构图表分析，机构干部统计表（基于 ECharts 实现）</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="47">
        <td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(20,42,73,0.05)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" textAlign="center"><p>系统管理</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(62,76,92,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>　用户与注册审批、按账号模块授权、国标字典、操作日志与登录日志、按用户类型的数据权限</p></content></td>
      </tr>
